  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 0cm 5.4pt;&quot;&gt;The information available to the local authority demonstrates that the single storey rear extension at 23 Warden Avenue HA2 9LP was in situ and in use as part of the main dwellinghouse for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application on 02/07/2026. The&amp;nbsp; single storey rear extension is therefore immune from enforcement action under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) and is lawful under Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 0cm 5.4pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 0cm 5.4pt;&quot;&gt;The proposal is therefore a lawful development.&lt;/div&gt;"
